{"2498890":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BOOM! Buster","steam_appid":2498890,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong><u>modern<\/u><\/strong> <strong>arcade game<\/strong>? Okay, that's pretty <strong><u>cool<\/u><\/strong>, actually.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silky-smooth animation, a bangin' soundtrack, and addictive platformer gameplay, all while carrying live bombs over your head. BOOM! Buster goes the extra mile to evolve the arcade genre into something entirely new.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boom! Buster takes place in a video game mirror of New York City. The Wizard has come out of retirement to take over New York by building his big bad &quot;Wizard Towers&quot;. What? Wrecking crew Buster and Bridget must tear them down in order to save the city.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game is SUPER hard, broh. And you MAY start to cry while playing it. Wahh! Wahh! That's you. Alright, haha, that was a bit too far, sorry.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bridget will drop BOMs periodically. If you don't sort them in time... BOOM! It'll all blow up in your face, killing you and your girlfriend on the spot.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to survive some tricky platforming along with the Wizard's minions and boss-fights through single screens of arcade chaos to save the city.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive<\/strong>, <strong>re-playable<\/strong> <strong>high-score chasing<\/strong> gameplay, with a collectible food in each level<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Playable Characters<\/strong> each with their own unique animations, physics, and voice-lines<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragr